  "description": "All-steel tube design offers more protection for the bottom and sides of the car, and prevents getting stuck on rocker plates or obstacles. It also includes a 6-inch leaf-shaped drop-down step pad for easy access for pickup trucks with lift kits and oversized wheel tires.\nFeatures\nDurable construction. All-Steel Side Steps are made with durable steel material, providing a long-lasting product that can withstand the elements.\nEasy installation. All-Steel Side Steps come with easy-to-follow instructions and all necessary hardware for installation.\nSlip-resistant. The stepping pads are specifically designed to provide a slip-resistant surface for safe entry and exit of the vehicle.\nWeather-resistant. All-Steel Side Steps are designed to stand up to the elements, including snow, rain, and extreme temperatures.\nCustomizable. Available in a variety of colors and styles, All-Steel Side Steps can be customized to fit any vehicle's look.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab,\nCompatible with 2019, 2010, 2011, 2022 2023 2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic Crew Cab.\nCompatible with 2010-2024 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab.",
